{
 "id": "fox-shield-pressure",
 "name": "Shield pressure",
 "part": "punish",
 "characters": [
  "fox"
 ],
 "shield": "theirs",
 "goal": "Keep the gaps on a shield too small for a shield grab",
 "why": "A shielding opponent grabs the moment it can. A neutral air that hits the shield late in Fox's fall leaves him a few frames behind; the shine on his first free frame is out before the grab lands, and hits the opponent out of it. If it holds its shield instead, a jump out of the shine and the next aerial do the same again.",
 "switch": "success",
 "reset": {
  "after": "quiet",
  "seconds": 1
 },
 "tutorial": {
  "what": "Short hop next to the shield with the stick lightly toward it, press A late so the neutral air hits just before Fox lands, L before the landing, and down-B on the first frame after it. Then out of the shine: a jump, and the next aerial.",
  "expect": "The opponent moves about and puts its shield up when Fox comes close; back away and it lets it down. A try begins when something hits its shield and is judged when Fox hits the opponent, or when it grabs or hits him. It grabs on the first frame it can, every time: with no gap in the pressure the grab never lands.",
  "example": [
   {
    "stick": [
     0.3,
     0
    ],
    "frame": 1,
    "hold": 900
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     0
    ],
    "frame": 1,
    "hold": 900,
    "from": {
     "near": 8.0
    }
   },
   {
    "press": "jump",
    "frame": 13,
    "hold": 1,
    "from": {
     "near": 8.0
    }
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     0.4,
     0
    ],
    "frame": 17,
    "hold": 10,
    "from": {
     "near": 8.0
    }
   },
   {
    "press": "A",
    "frame": 28,
    "hold": 1,
    "from": {
     "near": 8.0
    }
   },
   {
    "press": "L",
    "frame": 10,
    "hold": 1,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     -1
    ],
    "frame": 19,
    "hold": 3,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "press": "B",
    "frame": 19,
    "hold": 2,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "press": "jump",
    "frame": 25,
    "hold": 1,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "press": "A",
    "frame": 28,
    "hold": 1,
    "from": "start"
   }
  ],
  "marks": {
   "1": "Frame 1: the neutral air hits its shield, late in the fall",
   "10": "Frame {f}: L, before the landing",
   "19": "Frame {f}: down-B on the first frame after the landing lag",
   "25": "Frame {f}: X or Y out of the shine",
   "28": "Frame {f}: in the air: A. The next neutral air"
  },
  "lessons": [
   {
    "title": "The gap it is waiting for",
    "text": [
     "{opp} holds its shield and presses grab the moment its shield stun is over: {14} frames after the neutral air's hit, and the grab lands {7} frames later.",
     "A neutral air that hits early in the hop leaves Fox in the air and then in landing lag all that time: the grab has him as he lands."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
      "inputs": [
       {
        "stick": [
         0.3,
         0
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 900
       },
       {
        "stick": [
         0,
         0
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 900,
        "from": {
         "near": 8.0
        }
       },
       {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 13,
        "hold": 1,
        "from": {
         "near": 8.0
        }
       },
       {
        "press": "A",
        "frame": 20,
        "hold": 1,
        "from": {
         "near": 8.0
        }
       }
      ],
      "marks": {
       "1": "Frame 1: the neutral air hits its shield, early in the hop",
       "15": "Frame {f}: its stun is over. It grabs",
       "21": "Frame {f}: the grab lands"
      },
      "cues": [
       {
        "frames": [
         1,
         14
        ],
        "words": "Its shield stun",
        "kind": "info"
       },
       {
        "frames": [
         15,
         30
        ],
        "words": "It grabs",
        "kind": "late"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "title": "Late, then the shine",
    "text": [
     "Press A late in the short hop, so the neutral air hits just before Fox lands. L-cancelled, he can act {18} frames after the hit; its grab would land {20} frames after it.",
     "The shine hits on its first frame. On Fox's first free frame it is out before the grab: it hits the opponent out of its grab, or its shield if it kept shielding."
    ],
